        {
          "question": "Which colors and sizes can I request?",
          "answer": "Source colors are Red, Light Brown and Blue, with listed size labels 38-44. The Brown SKU is the pictured Light Brown shade. Specify each color-size quantity; measured fit and international size conversion are confirmed for the order."
