        {
          "question": "What sole and upper details are shown?",
          "answer": "Actual photos show separate rubber contact pads, a small rear heel extension, a slip-on opening, moc-toe stitching, embossed texture and double tassels. Driving moccasins describes the shoe style; no driving safety or tested grip performance is claimed."
        },
        {
          "question": "What are the minimum and quantity prices?",
          "answer": "The listing minimum is 2 pairs. Indicative unit prices are USD 16.80 for 2-49 pairs, USD 15.68 for 50-99 pairs and USD 14.56 for 100 or more pairs. Final quotation depends on color-size mix, packing, destination and agreed terms; freight and taxes are confirmed separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can I request samples or customization?",
          "answer": "Send the sample quantity, requested colors and any logo or packing requirements. Feasibility, applicable minimums, sample charges and customization options are assessed before quotation."
        },
